<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.disk.flushes ~ the whole-island flush: each shore writes what it holds in memory

`flush` asks the vessel to flush EVERY island that mounts a disk shore: the daemon's with each lit sibling's projector, and every resident wiki's, the same flush the teardown runs, through the custody door's `shore-flush` frame. It places no record, takes no argument and asks no confirmation; the answer names what each island wrote (`written`, with its `fileWrites`), what stayed `unwritten` (each with its state and why; a lit face's row names its face), or `answered: false` with the reason.

A composition sitting that stands no such flush refuses `flush-unavailable`. Exit 0 where every island wrote what it owed; 4 where a carrier stayed unwritten; 3 where an island, or the vessel, could not answer.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ flush

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`flush` params=`~ write every island's owed mirrors now`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel flushes its own mirrors; the verb takes nothing and places no record`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ flush-unavailable

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`flush-unavailable` params=`cure/[[carriage.disk.flushes]] ~ no composition sitting stands to flush; stand the vessel and run it again`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ whole · unwritten · unanswered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`whole` params=`exit/0 fields/[[islands whole]] ~ every island answered and left nothing unwritten`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unwritten` params=`exit/4 ~ a carrier stayed unwritten; the row names its state and why`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unanswered` params=`exit/3 ~ an island, or the vessel, could not answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares shore flush

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`spells/[[lares shore flush]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! shore_flush

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`spells/shore_flush ~ the seat`>>
```

